        "original_id": "05816700-d742-5927-ab4a-0dfd967f262b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Rolls-Royce Holdings plc, Rolls-Royce Naval Marine, Inc., Rolls-Royce\n- Products: AWJ-21\n- Concepts: underwater discharge water jet propulsion, propulsive efficiency, acoustic signature, maneuverability\n- Systems: Destroyer Class combatants\n\nFacts:\n- Rolls-Royce, a business established in 1904, designs, manufactures, and distributes power systems for aviation and other industries.\n- Rolls-Royce Holdings plc was incorporated in February 2011 as a British multinational public limited company that owns Rolls-Royce.\n- Rolls-Royce Naval Marine, Inc. developed AWJ-21, an underwater discharge water jet propulsion concept.\n- AWJ-21 was among the first technologies tested for Sea Jet.\n- AWJ-21 had goals of increasing propulsive efficiency, reducing acoustic signature, and improving maneuverability compared with previous Destroyer Class combatants.",
